以上、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\n\n(1)\nhttps://x.com/co2earl/status/1730145598295392373?s=46&t=_izxwsPkzrORhL3rlRwDXQ\n(2)\nhttps://x.com/mio_p_kasaken/status/1624763452014338049?s=46&t=_izxwsPkzrORhL3rlRwDXQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}